m/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Copilot Pull Request Reviewer","description":"","external_url":"https://github.com/features/copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","created_at":"2024-07-16T15:38:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T15:50:53Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","administration":"read","checks":"read","contents":"read","copilot_requests":"write","issues":"read","members":"read","metadata":"read","packages":"read","pull_requests":"write"},"events":[]}},{"id":3669686897,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz887auvpx","user":{"login":"Copilot","id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR disables key expiry for tagged nodes to match Tailscale's behavior. Tagged nodes (registered with tagged PreAuthKeys or via --advertise-tags) now have their expiry set to nil during initial registration. On re-authentication, tagged nodes preserve their disabled expiry while user-owned nodes can update their expiry from client requests.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Tagged nodes created with PreAuthKeys or advertise-tags now have key expiry disabled (set to nil)\n- Re-authentication logic for tagged nodes preserves the disabled expiry setting\n- Comprehensive test coverage added for tagged/untagged expiry behavior and re-authentication scenarios\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 2 out of 2 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| hscontrol/state/state.go | Added logic to disable expiry for tagged nodes during creation and preserve disabled expiry during PreAuthKey re-authentication |\n| hscontrol/auth_tags_test.go | Added comprehensive tests for expiry behavior with tagged/untagged nodes and re-authentication scenarios |\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Comments suppressed due to low confidence (1)</summary>\n\n**hscontrol/state/state.go:1325**\n* The OIDC/CLI re-registration flow in HandleNodeFromAuthPath does not preserve disabled expiry for tagged nodes. This is inconsistent with the PreAuthKey re-authentication logic (lines 1552-1556) which correctly checks IsTagged() before updating expiry. Tagged nodes registered via advertise-tags that re-authenticate through OIDC/CLI will incorrectly have their expiry updated. Add the same IsTagged() check here to preserve disabled expiry for tagged nodes.\n```\n\t\t\tif expiry != nil {\n\t\t\t\tnode.Expiry = expiry\n\t\t\t} else {\n\t\t\t\tnode.Expiry = regEntry.Node.Expiry\n\t\t\t}\n```\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","commit_id":"8c97d5ce6c15a6e1c556ca5f9c3113888dc03000","state":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3000#pullrequestreview-3669686897","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3000","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3000#pullrequestreview-3669686897"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3000"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-16T09:12:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T09:12:32Z","author_association":"NONE","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"c8cf9593a0ee134d6b46c6d07cb908d065c2785f","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGM4Y2Y5NTkzYTBlZTEzNGQ2YjQ2YzZkMDdjYjkwOGQwNjVjMjc4NWY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/c8cf9593a0ee134d6b46c6d07cb908d065c2785f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/c8cf9593a0ee134d6b46c6d07cb908d065c2785f","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-09T10:28:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-16T09:25:00Z"},"tree":{"sha":"79067d8ba7c04702e1c625687b3a977256a00207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/79067d8ba7c04702e1c625687b3a977256a00207"},"message":"state: disable key expiry for tagged nodes\n\nNodes registered with tagged PreAuthKeys now have key expiry disabled,\nmatching Tailscale's behavior. User-owned nodes continue to use the\nclient-requested expiry.\n\nOn re-authentication, tagged nodes preserve their disabled expiry while\nuser-owned nodes can update their expiry from the client request.\n\nFixes #2971","parents":[{"sha":"3689f05407225f8ad29c913e2c5dcfd24b53a85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3689f05407225f8ad29c913e2c5dcfd24b53a85f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3689f05407225f8ad29c913e2c5dcfd24b53a85f"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"231423cf6aaba0985282a27